let __v_403 = Value::from("Clear the screen before you set off, because it is a legal requirement: front demist on, air conditioning on (it dries the air), heat up and the air on fresh rather than recirculate. A clean inside windscreen stops the mist coming back; shaving foam polished off works for a week.");
