let __v_491 = Value::from("Find the right pressures on the sticker inside the driver's door frame or the fuel flap, not on the tyre, and check them cold before you drive: warm tyres read a few psi high. Most cars want about 30 to 35 psi, a bit more when fully loaded. Top up every couple of weeks, because under-inflated tyres wear the edges, cost fuel and make the car feel vague.");
